286
00:26:24.602 --> 00:26:34.602
When you, as a parent, tell your child, come on, let's take off our shoes, and you are going to shower now and you are going to bed now.

287
00:26:35.602 --> 00:26:40.602
Suppose it is half past nine and you have made an agreement with yourself that it is proper for Jantje to go to bed at half past nine.

288
00:26:41.602 --> 00:26:44.602
Then you say, we are going upstairs now and we are going to bed now.

289
00:26:44.602 --> 00:26:49.602
The most common reaction from teenagers is that they say, why?

290
00:26:50.602 --> 00:26:59.602
And basically, they actually want to engage in a discussion because they believe they have a better explanation than mom and dad.

291
00:27:00.602 --> 00:27:11.602
It is typical in today's psychology that we need to come to eye level with the child and that we have to explain everything how it works.

292
00:27:11.602 --> 00:27:16.602
But the authority as the Bible prescribes, here is a tip.

293
00:27:17.602 --> 00:27:20.602
The authority says, this is how authority works.

294
00:27:21.602 --> 00:27:27.602
If you want to make something clear to your child in love, that they are going to take off their clothes now and they are going to shower now and they are going to bed now.

295
00:27:28.602 --> 00:27:32.602
And the child says, why should I do that? Then you say, because I say so.

296
00:27:33.602 --> 00:27:38.602
This sounds really strict, huh, but that’s how it works.

297
00:27:38.602 --> 00:27:46.602
Because I say so, why? You have to balance this with wisdom in life, and of course there are other moments, you have to balance this with wisdom.

298
00:27:47.602 --> 00:27:48.602
Wisdom, people.

299
00:27:49.602 --> 00:27:59.602
Of course, there are moments when it’s like, tomorrow is school again, you have had a week off, tomorrow is school again, you have to get up at seven, and then you can explain the whole routine.

300
00:28:00.602 --> 00:28:10.602
Do you understand? But if you always try to explain everything to your child and you never show your authority as a parent, you will ultimately lose that authority.

301
00:28:11.602 --> 00:28:18.602
There are moments when you just have to say, because I say so. Or because I want to. You are going to do it now.

302
00:28:19.602 --> 00:28:26.602
