303
00:28:26.602 --> 00:28:35.602
And I was like, that's not a smart idea Kees. And he said, you are coming with me. And I said, but why? I just went out, I just had fun.

304
00:28:36.602 --> 00:28:41.602
And dad said, because I say so. You are coming with me. As long as you live in my house, you are coming with me.

305
00:28:42.602 --> 00:28:51.602
