307
00:29:01.602 --> 00:29:12.602
There was something in the gaze of that old man. That made me say to myself, you know what, then I’ll wash my sweaty head and go with my dry mouth.

308
00:29:13.602 --> 00:29:19.602
But you know, the effect is that I can stand here now to testify about the love of Jesus.

309
00:29:20.602 --> 00:29:24.602
